                        "review": "I have extremely found memories of playing this as a flash game around the summer of 2014-2015 on my aunts shitty macbook with Daft Punk's \"Digital Love\" playing on loop on the random flash games site <3 This game has been sitting in my library for a couple years and i only just now played it again and its exactly as i remember. fun shipbuiling, cool variety of parts, fun battles. its simple and nostalgic. love it.",
